## 4. $unionWith - 컬렉션 간 UNION

```javascript
// 2개 컬렉션의 데이터를 합쳐서 통합 타임라인 생성
db.userActions.aggregate([
  { $project: { userId: 1, action: "$type", timestamp: 1, source: "action" } },
  {
    $unionWith: {
      coll: "userTransactions",
      pipeline: [
        { $project: { userId: 1, action: "transaction", timestamp: "$createdAt", source: "transaction" } }
      ]
    }
  },
  { $sort: { timestamp: -1 } },
  { $limit: 50 }
]);
```

